# Scarlet Spider, Ben Reilly: "Web-slinging {R}{G}"; "Sensational Save - If Scarlet Spider was cast using web-slinging, he
# enters with X +1/+1 counters on him, where X is the mana value of the returned creature." Amazing Spider-Man: "Each legendary
# spell you cast that's one or more colors has web-slinging {G}{W}{U}." A spell with two web-slinging abilities may be cast for
# either (CR 702.188a, 118.9), and both are web-slinging. Bot1 casts Peter Parker as Amazing Spider-Man on turn 1 and Llanowar
# Elves on turn 3. On turn 5 Bot1 casts Scarlet Spider for the {G}{W}{U} Amazing Spider-Man gives, not its own {R}{G}, taps the
# Elves for the {G} and returns them. Scarlet Spider was cast using web-slinging, so he enters with one +1/+1 counter, the
# Elves' mana value.

